  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Tom and Ben are at school today. It is Fun Day. The hall has four tables. The tables have signs. Tom reads the sign at table one. It says: \"Draw a boat.\" Tom has a box of crayons. He draws a big blue boat. Ben draws a red boat.",
      "Table two has a ball. The sign says: \"Bounce the ball. Count to ten.\" Ben bounces the ball. Tom counts, \"One, two, three, four, five!\" Ben stops at nine. \"Can I try again?\" asks Ben. \"Yes!\" says Tom. Now Ben bounces the ball to ten. \"Ten!\" they say.",
      "At table three, the sign says: \"Close the box, please.\" Tom closes the box of crayons. Table four has a sign for a game. It says: \"Tick the correct picture.\" The pictures show a boat and a bus. The word is \"boat.\" Tom ticks the boat. \"That is correct!\" says Teacher Kim. Fun Day is fun."
    ],
    "summary": "Tom and Ben visit four tables at Fun Day. They read the signs and do what each sign says.",
